{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "locale": "zh-CN",
  "scenario_id": "5_02_020_22",
  "source_raw_hash": "sha256:d6fec3625f48b58a5f18c44c2989b27f3c17128b9138be9d39784f76978033c9",
  "entries": {
    "story-text:v1:5_02_020_22:5_02_020_22_a:cmd-000016:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:109bdbd9be9ba31170d5896a783199bd10aedbdf2853ddac4c3ef61a403e69b5",
      "text": "辛苦啦，●●●●プロデューサー。\n情人节送我巧克力谢谢啦！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_02_020_22:5_02_020_22_a:cmd-000021:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:cc7b1e3fa21acfab87ffb1ae23f19b82a5c0064dbff5bc6d6003e2490a4ba75c",
      "text": "我带了白色情人节的礼物来哦。\n快收下吧！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_02_020_22:5_02_020_22_a:cmd-000029:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:daa3af5c0ddec337d17019ad5f185e3855f55d166a497820ea260504fe14a7dc",
      "text": "关于回礼该送什么，我跟店员商量之后\n才挑出来的呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_02_020_22:5_02_020_22_a:cmd-000033:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b641eb7145d804f6d532d7dd5ad43e3d6443a7ad45e002967afa5c6879bb4215",
      "text": "要是能合你心意我就高兴啦！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_02_020_22:5_02_020_22_a:cmd-000039:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e996571ab899604b9090891315f540563a5a65ceca9f50f5a645d5d851638978",
      "text": "那么制作人！\n今后也请多多关照啦。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_02_020_22:5_02_020_22_b:cmd-000016:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:45bcf53fee449faa10a8a367317492cddad0b7fc6f83f7e08553beb46944aec5",
      "text": "●●●●プロデューサー，稍微方便一下吗？\n给，情人节的回礼！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_02_020_22:5_02_020_22_b:cmd-000021:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f2882eec9b240a81b6e015aa04500c6c4b9e465641ac24857128083f798e01ac",
      "text": "因为希望能让你高兴，\n我苦恼了好久才挑出来的哦。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_02_020_22:5_02_020_22_b:cmd-000028:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:99bb4072982f8754b4e2abe03f2a6836c16000fda8d8999403aa7cf0257066b2",
      "text": "查各种资料的时候还被老哥给嘲笑了呢。\n不过能找到好东西真是太好啦～",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_02_020_22:5_02_020_22_b:cmd-000034:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e909f3a0098ed8c97616ef0422bdf4521b8bee3adff566458534ace6991586ed",
      "text": "啊，对了！呐，现在有空吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_02_020_22:5_02_020_22_b:cmd-000039:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e779286f8ac2a68b0fc3d36df0720bafc4acf235ee56688593fceb8d0c5b78db",
      "text": "要是制作人方便的话，\n能不能稍微聊会儿天呀——什么的。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_02_020_22:5_02_020_22_b:cmd-000041:choice_short:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f649066e84ca071d72122bd1d0f796332363a05c8094250bbb2aa771be4991ce",
      "text": "好呀。我也想和隼人先生聊聊天呢",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_02_020_22:5_02_020_22_b:cmd-000042:choice_short:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c3fda866c1284ee4103fd07c7bd4479b1c97fc076938188dd39122d7e700da69",
      "text": "当然可以！我们一起聊聊吧",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_02_020_22:5_02_020_22_b:cmd-000048:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:1bf3251d8ed3516035ae7c6534f20c33166509e6fc2855ac2b1f58b995da7120",
      "text": "太好啦——！我想跟●●●●プロデューサー\n聊好多好多事情呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_02_020_22:5_02_020_22_b:cmd-000053:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:1f084b329db8fd06a38596ee39ada572a533af015eb6453c4c3ef321d1e287fb",
      "text": "来事务所之前我刚好买了点心，\n一边吃一边聊吧♪",
      "status": "draft"
    }
  }
}
